{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104230","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910423001:1":{"text":"Tentacle Guy sure knows how to hunt. He didn't need my help at all! And don't worry, he didn't go after any Shallowfolk.","source_cn":"触手男挺厉害，狩猎用不着咱帮忙——咱保证，他没有伤害浅海裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01F3FFA7ED58A7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910423002:1":{"text":"Figured I'd put my time to good use, so I went and gathered some materials to fix up my Waterstrider. *Cough* Spotted a conch along the way, so I picked it up too.","source_cn":"闲着也是闲着，咱就去找了不少修理和改装水行器的材料。咳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7C661C023AB7E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910423003:1":{"text":"You know... the one that's all the rage in Coralia.","source_cn":"就是……在塔拉萨挺受欢迎的那种。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31D7143CB0D8A579","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910423004:1":{"text":"Conch? Is that...","source_cn":"海螺？你说的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87F08ECBD364D025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910423005:0":{"text":"It's... uh, that one you kept bugging your sister for back home.","source_cn":"……就……就你之前在家，缠着你姐想要的那种。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70FBA439C064C36C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910423006:0":{"text":"Here.","source_cn":"喏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFA15317FF279DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::0":{"text":"装饰海螺","source_cn":"装饰海螺","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5BDAA27C8B1F9F99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910423007:0":{"text":"Is this... a moon conch?","source_cn":"这是……月旋海螺？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CF2AB80B3DA369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910423008:1":{"text":"It's super rare! Morin told me it can only be found deep in the coral reefs.","source_cn":"姐姐说这种海螺只有在珊瑚丛深处才能找到，很稀少也很珍贵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDF0D7CDF5A50F5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910423009:1":{"text":"Tolan... did you go out of your way to find this for me?","source_cn":"图澜，这个……是特意找来给我的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91EABACE33001FA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910423010:1":{"text":"Uh, not really... Just happened to stumble across it, that's all.","source_cn":"也……也不是特意……咱就是找改造材料的时候……顺便找到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9E81577ADA0D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1910423010":{"text":"Uh, not really... Just happened to stumble across it, that's all.","source_cn":"也……也不是特意……咱就是找改造材料的时候……顺便找到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9E81577ADA0D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910423011:1":{"text":"... Big guy!","source_cn":"……大个子！你——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x49A08E9C8437C828","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"... Big guy!","female":"... Lady!","variant_male_record_index":"256185","variant_female_record_index":"256186","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910423012:1":{"text":"Okay, okay. I believe you. You found this conch by pure chance.","source_cn":"嗯，我知道了，海螺是你“顺便”带回来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17D03E3645ED9460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910423013:0":{"text":"Anyway... I want you to have it.","source_cn":"总之就捡到了……你拿着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E6FAEEE22C6EA29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910423014:0":{"text":"Really? I love it! Thanks, Tolan!","source_cn":"真的给我吗？我很喜欢。谢谢你，图澜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36C9D93F0C4338F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:18::0":{"text":"小玩具车","source_cn":"小玩具车","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xED897AB059DE8310","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910423015:1":{"text":"Just take it... I've got plenty of stuff to fix up my Waterstrider anyway. Look at all this!","source_cn":"反正……咱找到了不少能用来修理和改造水行器的玩意儿，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2EAAF1350BE3F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910423016:1":{"text":"That's quite a haul! Wait, is that...","source_cn":"你找到了好多物资呀。咦，等一下，这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8F3B7486E4DEA2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910423017:0":{"text":"Whoa, you found a pearl clam!","source_cn":"……哇，你找到了白汐母贝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E452BA874A9FC98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1910423017":{"text":"Whoa, you found a pearl clam!","source_cn":"……哇，你找到了白汐母贝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E452BA874A9FC98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910423018:1":{"text":"This one's real treasure! Look at how it shimmers! Grandma says only clams that have lived for hundreds of years can make mother-of-pearl this beautiful, and this full of energy.","source_cn":"是一种非常稀有的贝壳。看，它的珠光比普通贝壳漂亮很多吧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C578BE3E37020C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910423019:1":{"text":"Nothing's worth more than this in Coralia. You could probably... trade it for a whole shell house!","source_cn":"这算是我们那里价值最高的贵重品啦，说不定……能换一整座...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA34503D4522E485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910423020:1":{"text":"... This thing's really worth a fortune?","source_cn":"……这贝壳这么贵重？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363CEDE250D3AC2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910423021:1":{"text":"You bet! You'd better keep it safe so you don't lose it. When we get back to Coralia—","source_cn":"是呀，你可要好好放起来，千万别丢了。等回了塔拉萨——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA9FC04A7C46AA78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910423022:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910423023:1":{"text":"I'm... not going back to Coralia.","source_cn":"咱……不回塔拉萨了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7696964A2BECE1D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910423024:1":{"text":"Ah, I'd better get some work done here when it's nice and quiet. Hey, big guy, mind turning my Waterstrider back to its normal size? Got some tinkering to do.","source_cn":"这里挺安静，适合干活。大个子，等会儿帮咱把水行器变回原...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD53DB5C1D23E6C4B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Ah, I'd better get some work done here when it's nice and quiet. Hey, big guy, mind turning my Waterstrider back to its normal size? Got some tinkering to do.","female":"Ah, I'd better get some work done here when it's nice and quiet. Hey, lady, mind turning my Waterstrider back to its normal size? Got some tinkering to do.","variant_male_record_index":"256198","variant_female_record_index":"256199","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910423025:1":{"text":"Once I'm done fixing it... I'm heading back to shore.","source_cn":"等修好了……咱就打算回岸上去。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF652AF2DF109DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Once I'm done fixing it... I'm heading back to shore.","female":"Once I'm done fixing it... I'm heading back to shore.","variant_male_record_index":"256200","variant_female_record_index":"256201","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910423026:1":{"text":"Tolan...","source_cn":"……图澜……你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D9CEDEE9EAED487","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910423027:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1910423028:1":{"text":"图澜绷着脸，不和你们任何人有眼神交流，而艾菲拉看着图澜，欲言又止。","source_cn":"图澜绷着脸，不和你们任何人有眼神交流，而艾菲拉看着图澜...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8D1DB52784DAD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1910423029:1":{"text":"你看得出，图澜并非真心想要离开，艾菲拉也对朋友的离去心有不舍。但不久前的争吵，让他们谁都不知道该怎么开口，更别提说心里话。","source_cn":"你看得出，图澜并非真心想要离开，艾菲拉也对朋友的离去心...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x911FFAFD1BC44368","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1910423030:1":{"text":"Food's ready. Come eat.","source_cn":"饭好了，来吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x479B889670E040F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1910423031:1":{"text":"Or go to bed hungry. Your choice.","source_cn":"或者，你们也可以选择饿着睡觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2301C76F6CC928F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1910423032:1":{"text":"卡律说完干脆利落地离开了，只留下你们三人在沉闷到令人窒息的氛围中面面相觑。","source_cn":"卡律说完干脆利落地离开了，只留下你们三人在沉闷到令人窒...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x48C613BDAB71D0E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1910423033:1":{"text":"你们在尴尬的沉默中起身，走向餐桌……","source_cn":"你们在尴尬的沉默中起身，走向餐桌……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x4371EFD4342815AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:0:1":{"text":"Pearl clam?","source_cn":"白汐母贝？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6DCF5397064D2178","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Pearl clam?","female":"Pearl clam?","variant_male_record_index":"96684","variant_female_record_index":"96685","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"You just randomly decided to dig around the coral reefs?","source_cn":"顺便去珊瑚丛深处挖了半天……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x196E64E06000A352","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You just randomly decided to dig around the coral reefs?","female":"You just randomly decided to dig around the coral reefs?","variant_male_record_index":"96678","variant_female_record_index":"96679","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"Oh, and the conch was already this clean when you found it?","source_cn":"顺便清理干净完好无损地带回来……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7568AE6A89D59CFC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh, and the conch was already this clean when you found it?","female":"Oh, and the conch was already this clean when you found it?","variant_male_record_index":"96680","variant_female_record_index":"96681","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:2:3":{"text":"Come on, just admit it's a gift for Elphira.","source_cn":"顺便作为之前发脾气的道歉礼物？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5328A2D956C385FF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Come on, just admit it's a gift for Elphira.","female":"Come on, just admit it's a gift for Elphira.","variant_male_record_index":"96682","variant_female_record_index":"96683","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:图澜":{"text":"Tolan","source":"图澜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:艾菲拉":{"text":"Elphira","source":"艾菲拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡律":{"text":"Calix","source":"卡律","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":42,"localized_text_count":41,"speaker_count":4}}